{"type":"text","timestamp":1770324168396,"sessionID":"ses_3d075e96affeObUq8UaLR4K3tF","part":{"id":"prt_c2f8b08e5001HH71aYUuM4aDjT","sessionID":"ses_3d075e96affeObUq8UaLR4K3tF","messageID":"msg_c2f8add31001qfSzQ40vjm6HZs","type":"text","text":"I've added a `middleware.ts` file to your project root. This middleware intercepts requests and logs the HTTP method and path to the server console.\n\nI've configured it to match all routes except for internal Next.js static files (`_next/static`, `_next/image`) and `favicon.ico` to keep the logs clean.\n\n**File created:** `middleware.ts`\n\n```typescript\nimport { NextResponse } from 'next/server'\nimport type { NextRequest } from 'next/server'\n\nexport function middleware(request: NextRequest) {\n  console.log(`${request.method} ${request.nextUrl.pathname}`)\n  return NextResponse.next()\n}\n\nexport const config = {\n  matcher: [\n    /*\n     * Match all request paths except for the ones starting with:\n     * - _next/static (static files)\n     * - _next/image (image optimization files)\n     * - favicon.ico (favicon file)\n     */\n    '/((?!_next/static|_next/image|favicon.ico).*)',\n  ],\n}\n```","time":{"start":1770324168395,"end":1770324168395},"metadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}}
